# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
$side: top;

.interpolated-group {
  border-#{$side}: {
    width: 1px;
    width: 2px;
  }
}

@page {
  margin: {
    top: 1px;
    top: 2px;
  }
}

.if-in-interpolated-group {
  border-#{$side}: {
    @if true {
      width: 1px;
      width: 2px;
    }
  }
}

```

